{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/12b983780b5e97bbc758c5f38ee0d321.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cursed time loop. Two friends. A deck full of decisions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fantasy</strong> - a world full of danger, secrets\u2026 and a suspicious number of golden statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills, play smarter with every loop and build your perfect automation setup. But beware: the world resets and the curse never sleeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Card Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between two story-driven cards at almost every step. Each one represents an event, encounter or opportunity that shapes your journey and reveals more of the fantasy world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card is linked to a skill. Chop wood to improve Woodcutting. Run to boost Agility. The more you do something, the better your character gets at it. Trained skills help you progress faster in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.poster.avif?t=1773338518\" width=780 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.webm?t=1773338518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious curse drains your life over time. Only speed, planning and well-trained skills give you a chance to push forward. Efficiency is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: glowing ancient statues rarely grant blessings.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you die, the world resets. The loop is part of the story, part of the puzzle and part of the gameplay. Escaping it might just be the Secret of Fantasy itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/2bff169eeabe13421e285b176fff6b7a.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card and Talent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards level up the more you use them. As they grow, they unlock valuable talent points you can invest to shape your build and unlock new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.poster.avif?t=1773338518\" width=780 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.webm?t=1773338518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and choose perks that support your strategy. They provide helpful bonuses that improve stats, reduce costs or boost certain actions during your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/519330d1b6f3286f93add3eff6949eb9.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation and Idle Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock automation features gradually. Set priorities, toggle automatic actions and let your strategy play out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully automated and turn-based. Improve your fighting skills and watch as your heroes face rats and other enemies with increasing confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humor and Pop Culture Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bruno and Patch are bursting with quips, jokes, and delightful nonsense.<br>Their dialogue is packed with pop-culture references and dry sarcasm, guaranteed to make you smile even in the darkest dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912050?t=1773338518","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912050?t=1773338518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/c0336d0f48dc1b7793b893d6e3ae459a97645aff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773338518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/c0336d0f48dc1b7793b893d6e3ae459a97645aff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773338518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/12b983780b5e97bbc758c5f38ee0d321.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cursed time loop. Two friends. A deck full of decisions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fantasy</strong> - a world full of danger, secrets\u2026 and a suspicious number of golden statues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master skills, play smarter with every loop and build your perfect automation setup. But beware: the world resets and the curse never sleeps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Card Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between two story-driven cards at almost every step. Each one represents an event, encounter or opportunity that shapes your journey and reveals more of the fantasy world\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card is linked to a skill. Chop wood to improve Woodcutting. Run to boost Agility. The more you do something, the better your character gets at it. Trained skills help you progress faster in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.poster.avif?t=1773338518\" width=780 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/113723c32eb987f6e18db34af79dac18.webm?t=1773338518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious curse drains your life over time. Only speed, planning and well-trained skills give you a chance to push forward. Efficiency is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pro tip: glowing ancient statues rarely grant blessings.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Time Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you die, the world resets. The loop is part of the story, part of the puzzle and part of the gameplay. Escaping it might just be the Secret of Fantasy itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/2bff169eeabe13421e285b176fff6b7a.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card and Talent Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards level up the more you use them. As they grow, they unlock valuable talent points you can invest to shape your build and unlock new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.poster.avif?t=1773338518\" width=780 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/49c0fd3e0b7ca28acdc70fbec9fb73a8.webm?t=1773338518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and choose perks that support your strategy. They provide helpful bonuses that improve stats, reduce costs or boost certain actions during your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/519330d1b6f3286f93add3eff6949eb9.avif?t=1773338518\" width=1560 height=152 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation and Idle Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock automation features gradually. Set priorities, toggle automatic actions and let your strategy play out on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fully automated and turn-based. Improve your fighting skills and watch as your heroes face rats and other enemies with increasing confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.avif?t=1773338518\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/extras_big/dd8d133904b15b29656a3343653d3793.webp?t=1773338518 width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humor and Pop Culture Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bruno and Patch are bursting with quips, jokes, and delightful nonsense.<br>Their dialogue is packed with pop-culture references and dry sarcasm, guaranteed to make you smile even in the darkest dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","developers":["Instable Loop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/34ca2ef0602409b884986de141c9a7bbd93a1916/header.jpg?t=1773338518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Secret of Fantasy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 or AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Instable Loop Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/d32dc175915f1e4f5699d84ba4553539d59dd828/ss_d32dc175915f1e4f5699d84ba4553539d59dd828.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/d32dc175915f1e4f5699d84ba4553539d59dd828/ss_d32dc175915f1e4f5699d84ba4553539d59dd828.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/78d50e29217cf98ac7ed17d9f1072d3443d881a9/ss_78d50e29217cf98ac7ed17d9f1072d3443d881a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/78d50e29217cf98ac7ed17d9f1072d3443d881a9/ss_78d50e29217cf98ac7ed17d9f1072d3443d881a9.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/ddfaea41394f5785ed2db652c0d2393c4ae63ddf/ss_ddfaea41394f5785ed2db652c0d2393c4ae63ddf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/ddfaea41394f5785ed2db652c0d2393c4ae63ddf/ss_ddfaea41394f5785ed2db652c0d2393c4ae63ddf.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/5ad7a4af5fcf77e5f17f06e0050637fa617b73d6/ss_5ad7a4af5fcf77e5f17f06e0050637fa617b73d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/5ad7a4af5fcf77e5f17f06e0050637fa617b73d6/ss_5ad7a4af5fcf77e5f17f06e0050637fa617b73d6.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/5947a8c05cb55108a072e8e5c9b25b1e997738ff/ss_5947a8c05cb55108a072e8e5c9b25b1e997738ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/5947a8c05cb55108a072e8e5c9b25b1e997738ff/ss_5947a8c05cb55108a072e8e5c9b25b1e997738ff.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/91425e7bc1c4c7262ce0573859a824f6909da498/ss_91425e7bc1c4c7262ce0573859a824f6909da498.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/91425e7bc1c4c7262ce0573859a824f6909da498/ss_91425e7bc1c4c7262ce0573859a824f6909da498.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/bc3cd897850d6170f84db28096729ee80ba12b58/ss_bc3cd897850d6170f84db28096729ee80ba12b58.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/bc3cd897850d6170f84db28096729ee80ba12b58/ss_bc3cd897850d6170f84db28096729ee80ba12b58.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/372bd8522cad5379dba18bfb734079de4845ddce/ss_372bd8522cad5379dba18bfb734079de4845ddce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773338518","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912050/372bd8522cad5379dba18bfb734079de4845ddce/ss_372bd8522cad5379dba18bfb734079de4845ddce.600x338.jpg?t=1773338518"}],"short_description":"A card-based idle-roguelite set in a cursed fantasy world. Bruno believes he is the hero, Patch knows better and both are caught in a relentless time loop. Plan your run, automate your choices, and grow stronger with every cycle until you uncover the secret of fantasy.","steam_appid":3912050,"support_info":{"email":"instableloop@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}